msgctxt "#30071"
msgid "Emulate the slow CPU access to the sprite RAM without changing the CPU speed. Sprite table changes made in the middle of the screen (raster sprite multiplexing) are shown a few lines later, as one block, like on real hardware. Fixes sprites that are cut off in Puyo Puyo."
msgstr ""

