msgid "Change video output and aspect ratio settings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30074"
msgid "Aspect Ratio"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30075"
msgid "Aspect ratio of the displayed picture. '4:3' stretches every picture to fill a 4:3 screen. 'X68000' reproduces what a real X68000 and its 4:3 monitor show: the size of the picture is computed from the CRTC and dot clock timing, so modes that use only part of the scan line or of the screen height (e.g. Cotton 512*256 Hi uses 75% of the width) get black borders. '1:1' shows square pixels at the core's raw resolution."
msgstr ""

